{"requirements":[{"id":"accounts","requirement":"Provision the local designer, reviewer, and visitor accounts.","status":"satisfied","summary":"All three accounts were absent initially, then provisioned and directly observed both before and after restart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-07caafd4dff04c5f","cmd-95ed851900884c53","cmd-16f161e0f5b74ee9","cmd-cf6506b071f543d9"]},{"id":"inherited-reviewer-access","requirement":"New directories and documents created by designer must inherit usable read/write access for reviewer.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Default ACLs grant reviewer access, and functional tests made designer create nested content under umask 077; reviewer then read and modified documents and created files in inherited directories. Fresh objects passed the same test after restart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-edb87a6b25c04f5b","cmd-1e8c456c6ea94592","cmd-eb9aea4e05e944c3"]},{"id":"visitor-denial","requirement":"Visitor must have no access to the project area or newly inherited content.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The project and inherited ACLs explicitly deny visitor and other users. Direct tests showed visitor could neither list the project nor read a new document, before and after restart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-edb87a6b25c04f5b","cmd-1e8c456c6ea94592","cmd-eb9aea4e05e944c3"]},{"id":"designer-ownership","requirement":"Designer must remain the owner of files and directories it creates.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Stat output directly identifies designer as owner of every tested designer-created directory and document, including nested and post-restart objects.","evidence_ids":["cmd-1e8c456c6ea94592","cmd-eb9aea4e05e944c3"]},{"id":"preserve-existing-content","requirement":"Preserve the existing project contents.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The original brief.txt retained its root ownership, mode, and baseline SHA-256 digest. Temporary verification content was removed, leaving only the original project file in the final inventory.","evidence_ids":["seeded